  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bf559695-bed4-4116-b543-2a34aa2aae2c",
    "name": "云商优选 · 简易电商后台 API（实训交付）",
    "description": "全栈项目开发前后端实训（选题 D 简易电商后台）接口集合，共 38 个请求，与 OpenAPI 文档 docs/swagger.json 一一对应。\n\n**使用方式**：\n1. 确认后端已启动（http://localhost:3000），数据库已初始化并执行 npm run seed；\n2. 先运行【认证 / Auth】中的「登录 Login」，脚本会自动把返回的 token 写入集合变量 {{token}}；\n3. 其余请求已继承集合级 Bearer Token 鉴权，可直接发送。\n\n默认账号：admin/admin123（管理员）、user/user123（普通用户）。\n变量：baseUrl=http://localhost:3000/api、token（登录后自动填充）。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
